#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:2
#, fuzzy
msgid "简易文字物件"
msgstr "Structure of text items"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:4
msgid ""
"上一节中我们提到可以使用 Typst 进行文字和公式的书写与排版， 而对于及为简单的显示普通文字的需求，也可以使用这一节介绍"
"的 :class:`~.Text` 来创建。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:8
msgid "文字物件的结构"
msgstr "Structure of text items"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:10
msgid ""
"文字物件的结构比较复杂，:class:`~.Text` 包含若干个 :class:`~.TextLine`，每个 :class:`~.TextLine` 包含若干"
"个 :class:`~.TextChar`"
msgstr ""
"The structure of text items is complex. :class:`~.Text` contains several :class:`~.TextLine`, and "
"each :class:`~.TextLine` contains several :class:`~.TextChar`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:12
msgid "比如，对于"
msgstr "For example, for"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:14
msgid "txt = Text('The first line.\\nThe second line.\\nThe third line.')"
msgstr "txt = Text('The first line.\\nThe second line.\\nThe third line.')"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:18
msgid "那么下图便说明了它的子物件情况， ``txt[0]`` 、 ``txt[1]`` 和 ``txt[2]`` 都是 :class:`~.TextLine`"
msgstr ""
"Then the following diagram illustrates its child items. ``txt[0]``, ``txt[1]``, and ``txt[2]`` are all :class:`~.TextLine`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:24
msgid "对于每个 :class:`~.TextLine` 而言，比如 ``txt[0]``，其子物件情况是如下图这样的"
msgstr "For each :class:`~.TextLine`, such as ``txt[0]``, its child items are as shown in the following diagram"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:32
msgid "其中 ``txt[0][3]`` 和 ``txt[0][9]`` 是空格"
msgstr "Where ``txt[0][3]`` and ``txt[0][9]`` are spaces"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:34
msgid "也就是说这是一个 :class:`~.Text` → :class:`~.TextLine` → :class:`~.TextChar` 的嵌套结构"
msgstr "That is, this is a nested structure: :class:`~.Text` → :class:`~.TextLine` → :class:`~.TextChar`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:36
msgid ""
"对于这种复杂的嵌套结构，如果你想要取子物件列表的切片，手动数数可能有点繁琐（比如上面例子的首行中，\"first\" 对应的切片是 "
"``[4:9]``）"
msgstr ""
"For such complex nested structures, if you want to slice the child items list, manually counting can be tedious (e.g., in "
"the first line of the above example, the slice corresponding to \"first\" is ``[4:9]``)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:38
msgid "为了解决这个问题，你可以参考预览界面的 :ref:`subitem_selector` 功能"
msgstr "To solve this problem, you can refer to the :ref:`subitem_selector` feature in the preview interface"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:41
msgid "字符的标记属性"
msgstr "Mark properties of characters"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:43
msgid ":class:`~.TextChar` 有四个标记属性，比如对于 “Ggf” 中的 “g” 字符而言："
msgstr ":class:`~.TextChar` has four mark properties, for example, for the \"g\" character in \"Ggf\":"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:49
msgid ":meth:`~.TextChar.get_mark_orig` 是字符在基线上的原点"
msgstr ":meth:`~.TextChar.get_mark_orig` is the origin point of the character on the baseline"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:50
msgid ":meth:`~.TextChar.get_mark_right` 是对字符水平右方向的标记"
msgstr ":meth:`~.TextChar.get_mark_right` is the mark for the horizontal right direction of the character"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:51
msgid ":meth:`~.TextChar.get_mark_up` 是对字符竖直上方向的标记"
msgstr ":meth:`~.TextChar.get_mark_up` is the mark for the vertical upward direction of the character"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:52
msgid ":meth:`~.TextChar.get_mark_advance` 指向下一个字符的 ``orig``"
msgstr ":meth:`~.TextChar.get_mark_advance` points to the ``orig`` of the next character"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:56
msgid ":class:`~.TextLine` 也有类似的结构，但是只有 ``orig`` 、 ``right`` 和 ``up``，没有 ``advance``"
msgstr ":class:`~.TextLine` also has a similar structure, but only has ``orig``, ``right``, and ``up``, without ``advance``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:58
msgid "有关更多与基线原点有关的内容，请参考 :class:`~.BasepointVItem` 。"
msgstr "For more information about baseline origins, refer to :class:`~.BasepointVItem`."

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:63
msgid "富文本"
msgstr "Rich text"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:65
msgid "可以使用起始标记和结束标记（像 HTML 那样的）应用富文本格式："
msgstr "Can use start and end tags (like HTML) to apply rich text formatting:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:67
msgid "具体写法是： ``<格式名 参数>被应用对应格式的文本</格式名>``"
msgstr "The specific syntax is: ``<format_name parameters>text with applied format</format_name>``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:69
msgid "比如，要想让文字的一部分变为蓝色，可以这样书写："
msgstr "For example, to make part of the text blue, you can write:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:71
msgid "Text('Hello <c BLUE>JAnim</c>!', format=Text.Format.RichText)"
msgstr "Text('Hello <c BLUE>JAnim</c>!', format=Text.Format.RichText)"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:75
msgid "``format=Text.Format.RichText`` 也可以简写为 ``format='rich'``"
msgstr "``format=Text.Format.RichText`` can also be abbreviated as ``format='rich'``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:77
msgid "Text('Hello <c BLUE>JAnim</c>!', format='rich')"
msgstr "Text('Hello <c BLUE>JAnim</c>!', format='rich')"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:83
msgid "这里的 ``c`` 是 ``color`` 的简写"
msgstr "Here ``c`` is an abbreviation for ``color``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/text.rst:87
msgid ""
":class:`~.Text` 使用富文本需要传入 ``format=Text.Format.RichText`` 或者 ``format='rich'`` ，否则默认情况下视作普通文本"
msgstr ""
":class:`~.Text` requires passing ``format=Text.Format.RichText`` or ``format='rich'`` to use rich text, otherwise it is "
"treated as plain text by default"

